('wuthering-heights','it','992f3a9ed1c5cedf4944902e782f1c1fa6345358c5093de165128d9759c409f1','A named geographical reference. Birthplaces, journeys and residences suggested by the characters remain conjectures or reports unless an actual scene is narrated. The outline is a modern geographical reference, not a reconstruction of eighteenth-century political borders.','Riferimento geografico nominato. Origini, viaggi e residenze suggeriti dai personaggi restano ipotesi o notizie, salvo una scena effettivamente narrata. Il contorno è un riferimento geografico moderno, non una ricostruzione dei confini politici del Settecento.'),
('wuthering-heights','fr','992f3a9ed1c5cedf4944902e782f1c1fa6345358c5093de165128d9759c409f1','A named geographical reference. Birthplaces, journeys and residences suggested by the characters remain conjectures or reports unless an actual scene is narrated. The outline is a modern geographical reference, not a reconstruction of eighteenth-century political borders.','Référence géographique nommée. Origines, voyages et résidences suggérés par les personnages restent hypothèses ou informations, sauf scène effectivement racontée. Le contour est un repère géographique moderne, non une reconstitution des frontières politiques du XVIIIe siècle.'),
('wuthering-heights','es','992f3a9ed1c5cedf4944902e782f1c1fa6345358c5093de165128d9759c409f1','A named geographical reference. Birthplaces, journeys and residences suggested by the characters remain conjectures or reports unless an actual scene is narrated. The outline is a modern geographical reference, not a reconstruction of eighteenth-century political borders.','Referencia geográfica nombrada. Orígenes, viajes y residencias sugeridos por los personajes siguen siendo hipótesis o noticias salvo escena efectivamente narrada. El contorno es una referencia geográfica moderna, no una reconstrucción de las fronteras políticas del siglo XVIII.'),
