('anna-karenina','it','212b736989dc15287b2a2e399c3ad050f672a0301e4b03ff5e5e01238229ac96','<p>Complete original Russian: 239 chapters in eight parts, based on PSS volumes 18 (1934) and 19 (1935). The epigraph is retained in the research corpus; the novel has no separate prologue or epilogue. Historical place names and uncertain estates are documented separately from modern coordinates.</p>','<p>Testo originale russo completo: 239 capitoli in otto parti, basato sui volumi 18 (1934) e 19 (1935) delle opere complete (PSS). L’epigrafe è conservata nel corpus di ricerca; il romanzo non ha un prologo o un epilogo separati. I toponimi storici e le tenute di identificazione incerta sono documentati separatamente dalle coordinate moderne.</p>'),
('anna-karenina','fr','212b736989dc15287b2a2e399c3ad050f672a0301e4b03ff5e5e01238229ac96','<p>Complete original Russian: 239 chapters in eight parts, based on PSS volumes 18 (1934) and 19 (1935). The epigraph is retained in the research corpus; the novel has no separate prologue or epilogue. Historical place names and uncertain estates are documented separately from modern coordinates.</p>','<p>Texte russe original intégral : 239 chapitres en huit parties, d’après les volumes 18 (1934) et 19 (1935) des œuvres complètes (PSS). L’épigraphe est conservée dans le corpus de recherche ; le roman ne comporte ni prologue ni épilogue distincts. Les toponymes historiques et les domaines d’identification incertaine sont documentés séparément des coordonnées modernes.</p>'),
('anna-karenina','es','212b736989dc15287b2a2e399c3ad050f672a0301e4b03ff5e5e01238229ac96','<p>Complete original Russian: 239 chapters in eight parts, based on PSS volumes 18 (1934) and 19 (1935). The epigraph is retained in the research corpus; the novel has no separate prologue or epilogue. Historical place names and uncertain estates are documented separately from modern coordinates.</p>','<p>Texto original ruso completo: 239 capítulos en ocho partes, basado en los volúmenes 18 (1934) y 19 (1935) de las obras completas (PSS). El epígrafe se conserva en el corpus de investigación; la novela no tiene prólogo ni epílogo separados. Los topónimos históricos y las fincas de identificación incierta se documentan por separado de las coordenadas modernas.</p>'),
('crime-and-punishment','it','11f8461bd63e752f3a9f67137a44d4de19672158b6ee11f877db68761434e8dd','<p>Original Russian: six parts (7, 7, 6, 6, 5, 8 chapters) and a two-chapter epilogue. Quoted transcription and comparison edition are attributed separately. Abbreviated streets and fictional buildings retain their uncertainty.</p>','<p>Originale russo: sei parti (7, 7, 6, 6, 5 e 8 capitoli) e un epilogo di due capitoli. La trascrizione citata e l’edizione di confronto sono attribuite separatamente. Le strade indicate con nomi abbreviati e gli edifici immaginari conservano il loro margine d’incertezza.</p>'),
('crime-and-punishment','fr','11f8461bd63e752f3a9f67137a44d4de19672158b6ee11f877db68761434e8dd','<p>Original Russian: six parts (7, 7, 6, 6, 5, 8 chapters) and a two-chapter epilogue. Quoted transcription and comparison edition are attributed separately. Abbreviated streets and fictional buildings retain their uncertainty.</p>','<p>Original russe : six parties (7, 7, 6, 6, 5 et 8 chapitres) et un épilogue de deux chapitres. La transcription citée et l’édition de comparaison sont attribuées séparément. Les rues désignées par des noms abrégés et les bâtiments fictifs conservent leur part d’incertitude.</p>'),
('crime-and-punishment','es','11f8461bd63e752f3a9f67137a44d4de19672158b6ee11f877db68761434e8dd','<p>Original Russian: six parts (7, 7, 6, 6, 5, 8 chapters) and a two-chapter epilogue. Quoted transcription and comparison edition are attributed separately. Abbreviated streets and fictional buildings retain their uncertainty.</p>','<p>Original ruso: seis partes (7, 7, 6, 6, 5 y 8 capítulos) y un epílogo de dos capítulos. La transcripción citada y la edición de comparación se atribuyen por separado. Las calles designadas con nombres abreviados y los edificios ficticios conservan su margen de incertidumbre.</p>')
